  "records": {
    "description": "This is a crafter that can handle up to two-material recipes. It uses a local divider clock for stability with random inputs. Adjust the number of copper bulbs for different clock speeds. Commonly used versions are 12gt and 24gt, but there is also a 4gt variant available. By using 3 copper bulbs, you can achieve a 48gt version. See the thread for the recipe setup guide.",
    "features": [
      "Random input safe",
      "SSI filtered",
      "Prefilled: eliminates the chance of crafting the wrong item",
      "Supports both single-material and two-material inputs"
    ],
    "considerations": [
      "Prefilling requires up to 13 stacks of items for each slice",
      "Available clock speeds may not be optimal for all recipes"
    ],
    "setup-guide": "- See bellow for Guide",
    "setup-guide:input-speed.": "- Single Material: 8gt input 4 item, Ratio: 2gt/each\n- Two Material: 8gt input 2 item, Ratio: 4gt/each",
    "setup-guide:output-speed.": "If the products is greater than 1, it can be directly multiplied by.\n- 4gt clock: 18k/h\n- 12gt clock: 6k/h\n- 24gt clock: 3k/h\n- 48gt clock: 1.5k/h",
    "setup-guide:craftable-list.": "Organized common recipes and the needed clock, \nif there is any error please let me know!\n- Single Material: \n  - ~~by 1: You don't need to use this~~\n  - by 2: chiseled stone bricks [4gt clock]\n  - by 3: paper, bread [12gt clock]\n  - by 4: snow block [12gt clock]\n  - by 5: minecart [12gt clock]\n  - by 6: door [12gt clock]\n  - by 7: ladder, composter [24gt clock]\n  - by 8: chest [24gt clock]\n  - by 9: compactor [24gt clock]\n- Two Material: \n  - 1 by 1: torch [4gt clock]\n  - 1 by 2: shulker box, cookie [12gt clock]\n  - 1 by 3: firework, book [12gt clock]\n  - 1 by 4: clock, lead [24gt clock]\n  - 1 by 5: hopper [24gt clock]\n  - 1 by 6: rail, armor stand, scaffolding [24gt clock]\n  - *1 by 7: dropper [48gt clock]*\n  - *1 by 8: note block [48gt clock]*\n  - 2 by 2: coarse dirt, diorite [12gt clock]\n  - 2 by 4: smithing table [24gt clock]\n  - 2 by 6: barrel [24gt clock]\n  - 3 by 2: fishing rod [12gt clock]\n  - 3 by 3: bow  [12gt clock]\n  - 3 by 4: anvil [24gt clock]\n  - 3 by 6: bookshelf [24gt clock]\n  - 4 by 2: fence gate [24gt clock]\n  - 4 by 5: TNT, sea lantern [24gt clock]"
  },
